      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The island’s largest freshwater preserve, Fisher Pond, spans 90 acres and is a popular spot for birdwatching and kayaking.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
