      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Vashon is the largest island in Puget Sound south of Admiralty Inlet, stretching roughly 15 miles from north to south.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
